<title>UK: Deutsche Bank unit adds 1.0 bln rand to 30-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank unit adds 1.0 bln rand to 30-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, has been increased to 3.0 billion rand from 2.0 billion rand.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    27.MAY.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  2.95	PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    2.80	SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/DE/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE  MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
